{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21002","headline":"梁台古愁 · 李贺","name":"梁台古愁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梁王台沼空中立，天河之水夜飞入。\n台前鬬玉作蛟龙，绿粉扫天愁露湿。\n撞钟饮酒行射天，金虎蹙裘喷血斑。\n朝朝暮暮愁海翻，长绳系日乐当年。\n芙蓉凝红得秋色，兰脸别春啼脉脉。\n芦洲客雁报春来，寥落野篁秋漫白。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}